# Build context limiter for ml/Dockerfile.
# PyInstaller only needs scripts/match_scorer.py and checkpoints/*.onnx;
# everything else (venv, dev notebooks, training data, eval reports,
# source-of-truth modules under src/, etc.) is build-time noise that would
# bloat the build context and slow the COPY steps.
#
# We use a positive whitelist rather than a denylist because this file lives
# next to a large ml/ tree where forgetting to deny something is easy.

# 1) Deny everything by default.
*

# 2) Re-allow only what the Dockerfile COPYs.
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!checkpoints/
!checkpoints/*.onnx